 font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">✅ পাওয়ার ইনপুট: 5V / 1A</p>',NULL,'Y7B0jXTjtHz6ZNNIWy9NxQkl.jpg',2200,2650,NULL,0.0,0,'top',3,0,1,'2026-10-12 13:42:59','2026-10-12 13:42:59','2026-10-19 19:55:05','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CkmMLJqf6VM',NULL,'V380 Q1 3MP','v380-q1-3mp-h-265-360-night-vision-security-camera','<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SolaimanLipi, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px\">V380 Q1 3MP </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SolaimanLipi, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px\">H.265 360° </strong></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SolaimanLipi, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px\">Night Vision </strong></p>','simple',1800,NULL,NULL,NULL),(23,40,4,'V380 Pro Dual Lens Wireless Camera C10','China','<p>V380 Pro Dual Lens 2MP+2MP Wireless Dome Camera WIFI Home Smart Protection Wireless CCTV Indoor Camera Two Way Audio.</p>\r\n<p>Real-time intelligent two-way voice intercom,</p>\r\n<p>2 Million high-definition pixels,</p>\r\n<p>Support cloud storage, TF card storage</p>\r\n<p>Apps Name : V380 Pro ( Play Store and Apple Store)</p>\r\n<p>Easy to install, has dual-light support lighting,</p>\r\n<p>The 360-degree panoramic rotation angle of view,</p>\r\n<p>Mobile phone remote viewing,</p>\r\n<p>Built-in Wifi</p>\r\n<p>Support two sensors and two screens</p>\r\n<p>Support video picture flip / mirror</p>\r\n<p>IR night vision : IR distance 8-12m</p>\r\n<p>Intelligent P2P technology, plug and play</p>\r\n<p>Push notification for iPhone/Android APP</p>\r\n<p>Support multi-user view, share with others</p>\r\n<p>Real-time image transmission, adaptive network</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p> </p>',NULL,'bpiLAOeo1jK6sOPOMrxrmcWV.jpg',1750,2250,NULL,0.0,0,'top',5,0,1,'2026-10-15 03:21:22','2026-10-15 03:21:22','2026-10-19 21:27:41','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36sODQ7Fr4A',NULL,NULL,'v380-pro-dual-lens-wireless-camera-c10','<p>2MP+2MP Wireless Dome Camera</p>\r\n<p>Two Way Audio.</p>\r\n<p>Apps Name : V380 Pro</p>','simple',1400,NULL,365,NULL),(24,8,3,'JIUJI WiFi Multi-Function Protector with Last State Memory— 63A, 220V AC','JIUJI','<h1 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 28px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">JIUJI WiFi Multi-Function Protector with Last State Memory – 63A, 220V AC</h1>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Protect your electrical system smarter with the <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">JIUJI WiFi Multi-Function Protector with Last State Memory – 63A, 220V AC</strong>, now available in Bangladesh from <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">STCMart</strong>. Designed for modern homes, offices, shops, commercial spaces, and electrical distribution systems, this intelligent protection device combines multiple electrical protection functions with <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">WiFi remote monitoring, energy measurement, automatic recovery, and smart control</strong> in one compact DIN-rail-mounted unit.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Based on the JIUJI <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">JJMVPD-63LWS</strong> platform, this smart protector is designed to monitor important electrical parameters and disconnect the power supply when abnormal conditions such as over-voltage, under-voltage, over-current, or leakage are detected. Once the electrical condition returns to a safe range, the device can automatically restore the power after the configured recovery delay.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Smart Electrical Protection for Modern Homes &amp; Businesses</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Voltage fluctuations are a common concern in many electrical installations. Sudden high voltage, low voltage, excessive current, leakage, unstable supply, or unexpected power restoration can potentially affect sensitive appliances and electrical equipment.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The JIUJI WiFi Multi-Function Protector provides several layers of protection in a single device. Instead of using separate monitoring devices for different parameters, users can monitor and configure multiple protection functions from the device itself and, with the WiFi version, remotely through the <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Tuya Smart / Smart Life ecosystem</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">1. Over-Voltage Protection</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">When the supply voltage rises above the configured safe level, the protector can automatically disconnect the load. The JJMVPD-63LWS supports an adjustable over-voltage protection range of approximately <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">230V–300V</strong>, with a default setting around 270V. The recovery threshold can also be configured according to system requirements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">This feature can help protect electrical appliances and equipment from abnormal high-voltage conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">2. Under-Voltage Protection</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Low voltage can also create problems for electrical equipment, particularly appliances and loads that require stable operating voltage.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The JJMVPD-63LWS provides adjustable under-voltage protection from approximately <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">140V–210V</strong>, with a default setting around 170V. When the voltage falls below the configured threshold, the device can disconnect the circuit and restore power after the supply returns to an acceptable range.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">3. Adjustable Over-Current Protection</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The device supports adjustable over-current protection up to its <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">63A rated current</strong>. For the 63A model, the protection setting can be adjusted within the specified operating range, allowing users to configure the device according to the connected electrical load.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">This makes it suitable for a variety of single-phase applications where monitoring and protection against excessive current are required.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">4. Leakage Protection</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">One of the important features of the <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">JJMVPD-63LWS</strong> is its integrated leakage protection function. The available technical documentation specifies an adjustable leakage protection range of approximately <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">10–99mA</strong>, with a default setting around 20mA.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">This provides an additional layer of protection for electrical circuits where leakage-current monitoring is required.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Important:</strong> This device should not automatically be considered a replacement for every dedicated MCB, RCBO, RCCB/RCD, or other required protective device. Final protection architecture should be selected according to the electrical installation, load characteristics, and applicable standards.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">5. WiFi Remote Monitoring &amp; Control</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The biggest advantage of the WiFi version is smart connectivity.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">After connecting the device to a compatible <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">2.4GHz WiFi network</strong>, users can monitor and control the electrical system remotely through supported smart-home applications such as <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Tuya Smart or Smart Life</strong>, depending on the device/app configuration.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">This means you can manage your electrical supply without being physically beside the distribution board.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">It can be particularly useful for:</p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Smart homes</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Shops and offices</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Rental properties</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Small commercial facilities</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Remote electrical equipment</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Electrical monitoring applications</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Solar-related electrical systems</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">6. Built-In Energy Monitoring</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The JIUJI multi-function protector is more than a conventional voltage protection device. It includes integrated metering functions for monitoring electrical parameters such as <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">voltage, current, power, energy consumption (kWh), frequency, and power factor</strong>, depending on the displayed measurement mode.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">This gives users better visibility into how their electrical system is operating and can help identify unusual consumption or load conditions.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">7. Last State / Power-Failure Memory</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Last State Memory</strong> function is especially useful in areas where power interruptions and load-shedding occur.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The device can retain its configured operating state/settings after a power failure, helping provide predictable operation when electricity returns. Technical documentation for the JJMVPD-63LWS identifies <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">power-failure memory</strong> as a supported feature.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">This can be useful when managing appliances, equipment, and electrical systems that need consistent behavior after power restoration.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">8. Automatic Reconnection</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">When an abnormal voltage, current, or leakage condition occurs, the protector can disconnect the power. Once the electrical condition returns to the configured safe range, the device can automatically reconnect after a preset delay.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The recovery delay is adjustable, with documentation specifying a range of <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">1–999 seconds</strong> and a default of approximately 30 seconds.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">This automatic recovery feature can reduce the need for manual resetting after temporary electrical abnormalities.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">9. Digital Display</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The built-in digital display provides convenient access to important electrical information. Depending on the display mode, users can view parameters including <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">voltage, current, leakage, frequency, power, energy consumption, and power factor</strong>.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">For electricians, engineers, and facility managers, having these parameters available directly from the protection device makes basic electrical monitoring much easier.</p>\r\n<h3 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">10. Compact DIN-Rail Installation</h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">The JIUJI JJMVPD-63LWS is designed for <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">DIN-rail installation</strong>, making it suitable for electrical distribution boards and control panels.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Its compact body is approximately <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">95mm × 39mm × 70mm</strong>, allowing convenient installation where panel space is limited.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Technical Specifications</h2>\r\n<table style=\"margin: 0px 0px 35px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.4; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; width: 1330px; border-collapse: collapse; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">\r\n<thead style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<th style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 10px; border-width: 0px 0px 2px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.075); vertical-align: middle; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); text-align: start\">Specification</th>\r\n<th style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 10px; border-width: 0px 0px 2px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.075); vertical-align: middle; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Lexend Deca\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); text-align: start\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Brand</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">JIUJI</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Model</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">JJMVPD-63LWS</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Product Type</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">WiFi Multi-Function Protector</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Rated Current</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">63A</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Rated Voltage</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">220V AC</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Input Voltage Range</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">AC 140–300V</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Over-Voltage Protection</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Adjustable, approx. 230–300V</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Under-Voltage Protection</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Adjustable, approx. 140–210V</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Over-Current Protection</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Adjustable up to 63A</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Leakage Protection</td>\r\n<td style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 15px 12px; border-width: 0px 0px 1px; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor currentcolor rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.106); vertical-align: middle; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; text-align: start\">Approx. 10–99mA adjustable</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; borde