al; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">1. What is the JIUJI JJMVPD-63LWS?</strong><br>The JIUJI JJMVPD-63LWS is a 63A WiFi-enabled multi-function electrical protector designed for single-phase electrical systems. It combines over-voltage, under-voltage, over-current, leakage protection, energy monitoring, automatic recovery, and smart WiFi control.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">2. Is the JIUJI JJMVPD-63LWS suitable for 220V systems?</strong><br>Yes. It is designed for single-phase applications and is commonly used with 220V/230V electrical systems.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">3. What is the maximum current rating?</strong><br>The model is rated at <strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">63A</strong>, with adjustable over-current protection according to the device’s specified operating range.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">4. Can I control the device remotely?</strong><br>Yes. The WiFi version supports remote monitoring and control through compatible smart-home applications such as Tuya Smart or Smart Life.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">5. Does it protect against high and low voltage?</strong><br>Yes. The protection thresholds for over-voltage and under-voltage can be adjusted according to the installation requirements.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">6. Does it provide leakage protection?</strong><br>Yes. The JJMVPD-63LWS includes adjustable leakage protection, with technical documentation specifying approximately 10–99mA.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">7. Does it automatically restore power?</strong><br>Yes. After an abnormal electrical condition is cleared and the supply returns to the configured safe range, the device can automatically reconnect after the selected recovery delay.</p>',NULL,'k1VX8bjDDfQhZvq1tDxoZ2g0.png',2200,2600,'Hot',0.0,0,'top',29,0,1,'2026-10-22 18:57:12','2026-10-22 18:57:12','2026-10-22 19:00:13','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m4KiRITNxZo',NULL,'63LWS','jiuji-wifi-multi-function-protector','<ul style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; line-height: inherit; font-family: \'Open Sans\', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: rgb(118, 118, 118); letter-spacing: normal; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Over Voltage / Under Voltage &amp; Overcurrent Protection</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">Built-in Kilowatt Meter</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">WiFi Remote Monitoring via Mobile App</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px\">1 Year Official Replacement (Excluding burns &amp; physical damage)</strong></li>\r\n</ul>','simple',1500,NULL,365,NULL);
